        </figure>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Rainforest Adventure with Lake Day Trip</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          3 Day, 2 Night Package<br /> from ฿5,200 Baht per person
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>2 nights at Riverside Cottages</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Includes guided Cheow Larn Lake tour</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Choose from canoeing, night safari or massage, half-day hike or hot springs</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <span>Note: This package includes a day trip on the lake – it does not include an overnight stay on the lake</span>
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/delight-cover.jpg"
            alt="Hiking in the jungle"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Hiking in the jungle</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Khao Sok Delight with Elephant Bath</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          3 Day, 2 Night Khao Sok Trip<br /> from ฿4,500 per person
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>2 nights at Riverside Cottages</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Choose from half-day hike or massage, canoeing or tubing, elephant bathing or lunch in the jungle</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <span>Note: This package does not include a stay on the lake</span>
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/spirit-cover.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok Tours"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok Tours</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Spirit of Khao Sok with Half-Day Hike</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          2 Day, 1 Night Package<br /> from ฿2,300 per person
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>1 night at Riverside Cottages</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Choose from canoeing or massage, half-day hike or hot springs</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <span>Note: This package does not include a stay on the lake</span>
        </p>
        <div class="my-10 aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-[#12281b]/15 bg-black">
          <iframe
            class="w-full h-full"
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/gikW1POav6Y?rel=0"
            title="YouTube video player"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
            allowfullscreen
            loading="lazy"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Khao Sok national Park Tours – Information</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Most people journeying to Khao Sok are drawn by the exciting activities and the stunning natural environment. Khao Sok <a href="/khao-sok-lake-cheow-lan-tours/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">lake tours</a> are high on the list and often take the form of a <a href="/khao-sok-2-day-tour/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">2 day tour</a>. This is to enjoy a night on the lake.
        </p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Some things to note when searching for a Khao Sok Tour</span>
        </h3>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How long should you spend in Khao Sok?</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          People often ask us this. In reality it depends on how much of a nature, outdoor and active person you are. Khao Sok is a wild and rugged place. The resort is comfortable, but the jungle and lake are different.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Many people like to spend a comfortable night at Riverside Cottages before embarking on a Khao Sok tour. Many lake tours last just one day.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          However, most people choose a tour that lasts at least two days. These tours often include an overnight stay to enjoy the lake. If nature and hiking is more your thing then one of the jungle tours will be more suitable.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Read our <a href="/khao-sok-travel-guide-how-many-days-to-stay-in-khao-sok/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">travel guide</a> for more information.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Things to do around the village</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The local Khao Sok villagers offer ever more activities as they see that many travelers want to explore deeper. This is your chance to get to know a bit more about the locals and <a href="/khao-sok-thailand-adventures/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Thailand culture</a>.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          You will find many activities from Thai and jungle cooking and trips along the Sok River. Visit a local farm or learn more about the Asian elephant at the Khao Sok <a href="/khao-sok-elephant-sanctuary/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">elephant retirement park</a>. This is not the usual tourist experience. You will get close to these magnificent creatures and get to understand what they are all about.
        </p>
        <h4 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Spelling</span>
        </h4>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Many people get the spelling wrong for Khao Sok.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The usual errors are Kaho Sok, Kaoh Sok, Koh Sok and Ko Sok or Kho Sok. Many people can explain these last ones by the fact that they are looking for the islands. Koh Sok or Ko Sok means the island of Sok in Thai. Khao Sok is not an island.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          In fact Khao is the Thai word for mountain. The mountains of Sok therefore makes much more sense.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Kaho Sok and Koah Sok are easy typos to make. For the best results, type in one of the following:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Khao Sok Tours</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Khao Sok national park tours</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Khao Sok national park excursions</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Khao Sok lake tours</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Khao Sok jungle tours</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/khao-sok-national-park-tours.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok national park tours"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok national park tours</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/khao-sok-national-park-tours-1.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok national park tours - Kaho Sok"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok national park tours - Kaho Sok</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Families traveling with children</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Khao Sok is a great place for adventurers. Kids and families also find it a paradise for who those that want to enjoy nature! People often ask us if Khao Sok is appropriate for children. The answer is yes – just use your best judgment, and seek advice when needed.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The Rainforest Adventure package is popular with families, as is the Khao Sok Delight. Contact us for help with <a href="/khao-sok-family-holiday-thailand/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">child-friendly</a> activities that suit the needs of everyone in your family!
        </p>
        <!-- Luxury Booking CTA Card -->
        <div class="my-12 p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl bg-[#12281b] text-white shadow-2xl border border-white/10 relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-6">
            <div>
              <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#ba9038] font-semibold">Reserve Your Experience</span>
              <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-white font-semibold mt-1">Ready to Book this Experience?</h3>
              <p class="text-[#abd0bb] text-sm sm:text-base mt-2 max-w-xl">
                No deposit required — book directly with our honor system guarantee. Free private shuttle pickup from the Khao Sok bus stop included.
              </p>
            </div>
            <a
              href="/booking-khao-sok-accommodation/?tab=package"
              class="px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-[#ba9038] hover:bg-[#d8b257] text-[#12281b] font-medium text-sm sm:text-base tracking-wide transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl flex-shrink-0"
            >
              Book Package Now →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 pt-12 border-t border-[#12281b]/10"><GoogleReviewsWidget /></div>
    </div>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
